  "provider_query": "用中文找 Rust 所有权机制的英文原文，要 The Rust Book 的 ownership 章节",
  "answer": "《The Rust Programming Language》（The Rust Book）所有权章节的英文原文，主要在官方文档第 4 章 **Understanding Ownership**。\n\n1. **章节入口：Understanding Ownership**  \n   https://doc.rust-lang.org/book/ch04-00-understanding-ownership.html  \n   官方稳定版第 4 章总览：所有权、借用、切片，以及内存布局。来源：[The Rust Programming Language](https://doc.rust-lang.org/book/ch04-00-understanding-ownership.html)。\n\n2. **核心小节：What is Ownership?**  \n   在全书打印版中对应 “What Is Ownership?”，给出三条规则：每个值有一个 owner；同时只能有一个 owner；owner 离开作用域时值被 drop。  \n   来源：[doc.rust-lang.org/book/print.html](https://doc.rust-lang.org/book/print.html)。\n\n3. **全书首页（稳定版）**  \n   https://doc.rust-lang.org/stable/book/  \n   也可用 `rustup doc --book` 离线打开。来源：[The Rust Programming Language](https://doc.rust-lang.org/stable/book/)。\n\n4. **GitHub 镜像**  \n   https://rust-lang.github.io/book/  \n   与官方 HTML 对应。来源：[rust-lang.github.io/book](https://rust-lang.github.io/book/)。\n\n5. **旧链接重定向说明**  \n   https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/book/ownership.html  \n   旧 “Ownership” 页会指向新版，并复述三条所有权规则。来源：[doc.rust-lang.org nightly](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/book/ownership.html)。\n\n6. **历史版本示例（1.39）**  \n   https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.39.0/book/ch04-01-what-is-ownership.html  \n   同一小节的较早英文原文。来源：[Rust 1.39 book](https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.39.0/book/ch04-01-what-is-ownership.html)。\n\n7. **第二版镜像（MIT）**  \n   https://web.mit.edu/rust-lang_v1.26.0/arch/amd64_ubuntu1404/share/doc/rust/html/book/second-edition/ch04-00-understanding-ownership.html  \n   第二版 “Understanding Ownership” 英文页。来源：[MIT Rust 1.26 docs](https://web.mit.edu/rust-lang_v1.26.0/arch/amd64_ubuntu1404/share/doc/rust/html/book/second-edition/ch04-00-understanding-ownership.html)。\n\n8. **Brown 实验版（非官方正文，但同主题）**  \n   https://rust-book.cs.brown.edu/ch04-01-what-is-ownership.html  \n   带可视化的实验改写，不是标准书正文。标准英文原文以 `doc.rust-lang.org` 为准。来源：[rust-book.cs.brown.edu](https://rust-book.cs.brown.edu/ch04-01-what-is-ownership.html)。\n\n同章后续英文小节通常还有：References and Borrowing、The Slice Type。从第 4 章入口页的目录即可进入。",
